# Any of several [[pelargonium]]s having [[leaves]] with a [[rose]] [[scent]], including inportant sources of [[rosewater]] and of [[rose]] fragrances. Although said to be the species {{taxlink|Pelargonium graveolens|species|noshow=1}}, {{taxlink|Pelargonium capitatum|species|noshow=1}} and {{taxlink|Pelargonium radens|species|noshow=1}}, the rose geraniums in cultivation are pretty much all hybrids, with those species among the parents.

